\end{eqnarray}
 We have  already dealt with the second integral in Lemma \ref{lemma density function=1} from which we obtain  $$\Big|\int_{\Gamma\setminus \Gamma_{\delta}}K (x',y) \ast  (f(x')-f(x)) \Big|\leq |f(x')-f(x)|\leq C \delta^\alpha.$$
  Now  we estimate the first term in (\ref{eq: I_2 decompoes}). Note that it holds that   $|y- x |\leq|y- x'|+| x -x'|\leq 2|y- x'|$ for  $y\in \Gamma\setminus\Gamma_{\delta}$. Then
