\begin{figure}[tb]
    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.95\linewidth]{figures/real_world_no_CoT.pdf}
    \caption{There is good evidence that BAPO-difficulty translates to real-world settings. LLMs can solve real-world tasks that contain BAPO-easy problems (left plot) with much greater accuracy than BAPO-hard problems (two plots on the right).}
