    \caption{Temporal evolution of the MEQ cloud’s spatial extent. The three rows correspond to the training (top), validation (middle), and test (bottom) datasets. In each row, the solid curve shows the observed 50th-percentile distance (\(P_{50}\)) and the dashed curve the observed 95th-percentile distance (\(P_{95}\)). Forecasts from the 1-, 15-, and 30-second models are plotted in blue, red, and green, respectively. Shaded regions denote \(\pm\sigma\) (standard deviation).}

    \label{fig:spatial_extent_history}
