The article is structured as follows.
In Section~\ref{sec: tools}, we introduce the main concepts and tools needed for our purposes.
In Section~\ref{sec: wandering}, we go over general properties of regular flows and provide several examples.
Finally, in Section~\ref{sec: results}, we provide a full classification of regular planar flows.

