        \item for every $\alpha,\beta\in\cF$, either $\alpha=\beta$ of $\alpha\cap\beta=\emptyset$;
        \item $\displaystyle\bigcup_{\alpha\in\cF}\alpha=\bR^2$;
        \item $\cF$ is locally homeomorphic to a family of parallel lines.
