Replay datasets are known to mitigate catastrophic forgetting in continual pretraining \cite{scialom2022finetunedlanguagemodelscontinual}. Accordingly, we built a pseudo-replay dataset using widely adopted public corpora, such as FineWeb \cite{fineweb2024}, CC \cite{commoncrawl2025}, Wikipedia, and GitHub Code, since most open-weight models do not disclose their dataset compositions. To enhance Korean language performance, we further incorporated a substantial portion of Korean corpora from sources like AIHub \cite{aihub2025} and NIKL \cite{klri2025}.



