\title{On the dynamical evolution of randomness\\ Part B: Geometrisation and the origin of convergence in LLN }

\author{Allen Lobo\thanks{allen.e.lobo@outlook.com}\\Dept. of Physics, St. Joseph's University, Bengaluru, Karnataka, India.}
