\begin{remark}
We discussed the inviscid limit problem for the barotropic model in \cite{HM2}. So, the inviscid limit problems for the full system {\rm (\ref{nrs0})} with $\mu, \ \kappa \to 0$ seem a very interesting problem in the future. In particular, as for the inviscid 
limit problem $\mu \to 0$,
