\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclude}
This work presents TMU, a reconfigurable near-memory TMU designed to accelerate DMI operators in modern AI workloads. 
By addressing the frequently neglected latency bottlenecks introduced by TM operators, TMU significantly enhances system throughput across multiple state-of-the-art models.
Despite its compact hardware footprint, the TMU delivers substantial performance gains and demonstrates strong scalability and integration potential within high-throughput AI SoCs.


