&\cong(|Z|_{Ber}\times_{|Y|_{Ber}}|V|_{Ber})\setminus(|Z|_{Ber}\times_{|Y|_{Ber}}|V|_{Ber}\times_{|Y|_{Ber}}|U|_{Ber}),
   \end{align*}
where we have used that $V\rightarrow X$, $V\rightarrow Y$, and $U\rightarrow Y$ are open immersions.
