       $$\mathbf{Q}(\mathcal{Z})\rightarrow\mathbf{Q}(\overline{\mathrm{im}}(g))$$
       is an equivalence if and only if 
          $$\mathbf{Q}(\mathcal{Z})\rightarrow\mathbf{Q}(\overline{\mathrm{im}}(g\circ f))$$
          is.
\end{proof}

\begin{remark}
